  "an8.63:0.3": "<p><i>This discourse is important in that it explicitly refers to the practice of the four establishings of mindfulness as a form of concentration practice, mastered in terms of the levels of jhāna.</i></p><p>See also: <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn44'>MN 44</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn119'>MN 119</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn47.8'>SN 47:8</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.41'>AN 4:41</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an5.27'>AN 5:27—28</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an9.35'>AN 9:35</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an10.71'>AN 10:71</a></p>",
